# M35 Stage 3 - line endings are LF in every checkout, including GitHub's Windows runner,
# whose default autocrlf turned every file CRLF and made vitest fail to load any test
# importing an .mjs from scripts/ ("Invalid or unexpected token"; reproduced locally by
# converting the files to CRLF). A .ts import from the same CRLF file was fine; the
# .mjs path through vitest was not. Pin the checkout instead of chasing the runner.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.wav binary
*.zip binary
*.asar binary
